:GRAPH RATES
:TITLE Order, Average order, Desired production and Production rate
:SCALE
:VAR Order rate
:Y-MIN 900
:Y-MAX 1300
:VAR Average order rate
:Y-MIN 900
:Y-MAX 1300
:VAR Desired production rate
:Y-MIN 900
:Y-MAX 1300
:VAR Production rate
:Y-MIN 900
:Y-MAX 1300
:LINE-WIDTH 2
:GRAPH INVENTORY
:TITLE Inventory vs Desired inventory
:SCALE
:VAR Desired inventory
:Y-MIN 2800
:Y-MAX 5200
:LINE-WIDTH 3
:VAR Inventory
:Y-MIN 2800
:Y-MAX 5200
:LINE-WIDTH 2
